WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:05.730
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and during my
Seeing Red video I asked you all to submit

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.700
questions about the rest of the season and
the big WTF reveals.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.269
So I picked 10 of them to answer in this video
with one bonus question.

00:00:12.269 --> 00:00:14.940
Also if you’re finding me for the first
time, just because this season of Arrow has

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:22.220
been so awesome, I’m doing a special series
of bonus videos counting down to the finale.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.490
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.490
They post each Wednesday before the episodes
air.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:27.269
Feel free to leave me suggestions for those
in the comments.

00:00:27.269 --> 00:00:31.489
So let’s talk some Connor Hawke and Deathstroke,
careful for spoilers for everything through

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:33.580
episode 20 if you’re not caught up.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:39.630
Here we go, Question 1 - Rose Lily asks Will
Oliver tell Thea that he is the green arrow

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:40.750
now?

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:45.520
I think that person he tells in the trailer
for the next episode is Thea.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:52.400
It could be a misdirect, because Thea talks
about being sick of all the lies and we know

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.710
that Merlyn is back, so she could just be
talking to Merlyn in that scene and Oliver

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:57.320
could be talking to someone else.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.890
But I think Thea will know the truth by the
finale.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:03.910
I mean everyone else in Oliver’s family
seems to know at this point.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.850
And Quentin is the only main-character besides
her that doesn’t know.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:09.840
So Oliver is either telling him or Thea.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:14.909
Question 2 - Tim asks Do you think Roy will
be fixed or healed before the Season Finale?

00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:22.540
Yes, I think all of the Mirakuru drama with
the army of super soldiers will be over by

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.540
then.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.319
In the episode description for streets of
fire, episode 22, it mentions Caitlin Snow

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:29.670
making a big breakthrough at STAR Labs.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:34.020
So they probably get the cure in that episode
and use it, but that won’t be the end of

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.020
it.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:39.319
I think in the finale Slade’s army will
be gone and it will just be Team Arrow VS

00:01:39.319 --> 00:01:40.499
Team Deathstroke.

00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:42.569
Just the core main characters this season.

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:48.179
I think the big theme this season or at least
the second half of the season, is Full Circle.

00:01:48.179 --> 00:01:50.729
So think back to where Oliver and Slade started.

00:01:50.729 --> 00:01:52.880
They were on the island.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.789
Gradually new characters came in and eventually
we got all the new Team Arrow people, Slade

00:01:56.789 --> 00:01:58.939
has his team and his army.

00:01:58.939 --> 00:02:02.959
Now a bunch of them are going to go away or
die.

00:02:02.959 --> 00:02:06.240
So these last couple of episodes we’re traveling
back to the beginning.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:10.670
So the final moments will be just like things
were when everything started on the island.

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:11.710
Just Oliver and Slade.

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:16.350
I’m also saying that the final moments of
the finale, will probably take place on the

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:17.350
island.

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:21.650
Question 3 - The PTMD3 asks Who's Connor Hawke?

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:27.750
I’m going to just take from recent comic
book history but Connor Hawke is the son of

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.240
Oliver Queen and Sandra Hawke.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.860
In the new 52 comics he’s the Red Arrow.

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:37.170
So everyone is expecting this new kid of Oliver’s
to turn out to be Connor.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:41.950
They could be doing something different on
the show and Gender Bend the character.

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:46.530
I think that it would be wasting too much
of an opportunity for them to just make the

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:49.110
child a normal non-comic book character.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:53.230
But even if it is Connor, that doesn’t mean
Oliver’s going to train him right away.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.290
I mean in the timeline of the show he’s
about 6 or 7.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:03:01.090
So basically this child, we’re hoping is
the implied heir of the Green Arrow legacy,

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.310
someday, when Oliver dies or retires.

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:05.230
This child will take up the Mantle.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:08.291
Just like some of the Robin’s in the Batman
comics have taken up the mantle of the Bat

00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:10.410
when Bruce Wayne goes away for a long period
of time.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:15.120
Question 4 - Manuel Cortez asks Is Oliver's
son the next person who has to die according

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.210
to Slade or will he live and Oliver will train
him?

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.530
Otherwise why bring that issue to the show?﻿

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:24.770
There’s a couple of reasons they could be
dumping this info on us now.

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:27.760
First off, I definitely think the child will
figure into the finale.

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:35.040
Otherwise they would have waited to introduce
him in the season 3 cliffhanger.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.760
That doesn’t mean Slade will try to kill
him.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:38.730
But he’s defnitely done his homework on
Oliver.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:43.560
So I think he knows about the child and will
hang him, so to speak, over Oliver’s head.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:48.310
That could either be like Slade doing that
same pick who dies moment using Felicity and

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.410
Oliver’s Son.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:55.800
Or he could just straight up kidnap him and
take him to the island to raise as his own.

00:03:55.800 --> 00:04:00.670
We have to end up back on the island some
how, so someone is getting kidnapped either

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.670
way.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:06.370
Question 5 - Monika Pain asks what was Moira
going to say about Malcolm before Slade attacked

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.370
them?

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.820
She was just going to tell them he’s still
alive.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:14.280
Merlyn really just said that he wanted Thea,
he wanted his daughter to be with him.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.840
So I think he’s going to offer to take her
away.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:21.100
If he has a secret plan involving Thea, they
show hasn’t revealed it yet.

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.970
He’s not coming back till episode 22.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:27.070
So whatever is happening between Daddy and
Daughter will go down then.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:31.870
Question 6 - Laxus Dreyar asks Do you think
Oliver or Thea will take up Moira’s run

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.100
for Mayor?

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:37.740
They could totally do the Oliver Queen as
Mayor story from the comics.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:42.350
It would be an interesting wrinkle in whatever
the big story of season 3 is.

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:44.810
Mayor and daddy by day, vigilante by night.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:48.280
I think I’d rather see Diggle or someone
else be mayor, but I wouldn’t be surprised

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:49.940
if Oliver takes the job.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:54.180
I don’t think anyone expects Brother Blood
to make it to Season 3 still being mayor.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.990
I think Laurel will totally kill him in the
finale.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:05:02.630
Question 7 - Sergio asks who's worse at keeping
their secret identity a secret, Oliver Queen/Arrow

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:03.630
or Bruce Wayne/Batman?﻿

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:11.290
Definitely Oliver, like I said: Pretty much
his whole family except for Thea found out.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:16.180
Barry knows, everyone at ARGUS and some of
his biggest enemies like Merlyn and Slade.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:20.900
Brother Blood doesn’t know, which I think
tells you just how important his character

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:21.900
is.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:22.900
As in he’s not that important.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:28.860
Batman’s identity has been found out by
a few villains and super smart characters,

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:31.050
but generally it’s really really rare.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:35.811
Question 8 - Bobby asks what is your thoughts
about them creating a new shared DC Universe

00:05:35.811 --> 00:05:37.990
with the movies and tv shows?

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:40.080
What do you think they should include in that?

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:44.200
So David Goyer said something recently, he’s
mostly known for writing comics and he’s

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:48.520
the one writing the Superman VS Batman movie.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:54.010
He said that Warner Brothers, who owns all
the movie rights and they own DC Comics, isn’t

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.900
quite ready for a unified system like Marvel.

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:01.180
Not enough of the right people in charge are
on board with the idea.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:08.210
The problem is, you just have an army of producers
and writers who all want to do their own thing.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:15.810
And in order to do a shared movie and tv universe
it has to be a priority for everyone from

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.270
the top down.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:21.480
When they do get that figured out I think
it should be just like Marvel’s version.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:28.400
All the studio and netflix movies and tv shows
should exist in the same universe.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:37.300
And let the comics and the animated shows
exist separately.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:42.520
Question 9 - Brad Gilbert asks Does killing
Moira give Merlyn andTeam Arrow a reason to

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:43.520
unite?

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:47.550
Definitely, but I think the real thing that
will convince Merlyn to fight with Oliver

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.770
will be Thea asking him to help.

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:50.780
Asking him as her father.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.570
Like she says I’ll let you be a part of
my life if you help my friends and family

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:57.260
defeat Slade.

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:02.540
So for Merlyn I think it will be more of a
temporary truce with Team Arrow.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:07.260
He doesn’t hate Oliver, but as Stephen Amell
once said: “They have unfinished business”.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:12.699
He was talking mostly about Tommy and the
Undertaking from season 1.

00:07:12.699 --> 00:07:17.680
Question 10 - Dansky Games asks do you, think
that the last person that slade said has to

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:18.990
die is Himself?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:22.180
I think that’s a really important thing
to consider.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:24.710
I don’t know the whole plot of the finale
or anything.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:29.650
But I think it would a really awesome twist,
if Slade during the process of the finale.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:33.990
Starts to realize what he’s done and is
just so overcome with greif that he asks Oliver

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:39.350
to Kill Him and end it all.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:46.710
In that situation, killing him would be like
an act of mercy.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:50.740
So I don’t think Oliver will do it, he’ll
prevent Slade from dying or killing himself,

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.480
so he has to live with all the bad things
he’s done since taking the mirakuru.

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:57.639
Bonus Question - Red Arrow asks do you think
that Oliver’s child and the mother will

00:07:57.639 --> 00:07:59.500
be featured on The Flash show this fall?﻿

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:03.040
Yes, but only in episodes that invoke people
from Arrow.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:06.520
I don’t expect the Flash to cast them as
regulars.

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:10.651
I think we’ll only see them when Oliver
visits the Flash show or when the Flash show

00:08:10.651 --> 00:08:11.910
crosses over with Arrow.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.350
That doesn’t include being mentioned.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:16.740
I think Oliver and Team Arrow will talk about
his kid a lot and we just won’t see them.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:21.220
Like they’ve been talking a lot about Barry,
but we haven’t actually seen him since episode

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:22.220
9.

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:26.220
So thank you so much for submitting questions,
this was a lot of fun as always.

